	(text "OUTPUT CHANNEL (hardware design section 6). Nine instances: Z1 to Z8 and MV.\nThe valve sits between a COM terminal and OUT. Current returns through PTC F1, the triac\nand the shared shunt (ISNS) to GND. The gate is fired from T2 through opto-triac U1 and R3,\nso gate current has the polarity of T2: quadrants I and III, which every triac supports.\n\nQ1  T810-600B-TR, 8 A, three-quadrant, DPAK. Pin 1 A1 (T1) to ISNS, pin 2 and tab A2 (T2), pin 3 gate.\n    The tab is net T2: give it its own copper island of 2 cm2 or more (section 6.7).\nU1  MOC3023, random phase. LED current 7.1 mA worst case, 12 mA typical; it needs 5.6 mA at -20 C.\nR1  150R sets the opto LED current. R2 680R gives the indicator LED 1.6 mA.\nR3  100R limits the opto-triac to 0.45 A at the 45 V peak. R4 1k holds the gate at T1.\nR5 + C1  47R and 10 nF snubber. F1 PTC 1.1 A hold, 40 A maximum. D1 SMBJ48CA clamps at 77 V.\nD2  lights when the expander pin is low AND V_DRV is on: the real drive state.\n\nZD_N is low to turn the output on. V_DRV is removed by the fail-safe circuit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3399306f-78ec-510e-8880-879f2c18a897")
	)
	(text "Drive: opto LED and indicator"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 62.23 61.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d7baf96-358e-5cc0-916f-103a0f950adf")
	)
	(text "4-ZONE BUILD: instances Z5 to Z8 are not fitted\n(KiCad variant \"4-zone\"). Z1 to Z4 and MV always are."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 147.32 0)
		(effects
